                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nice vision but at the moment it's too far. You want to be a farmer? Ok, here's the tool but we'll implement farming in the distant future. I would wait for a couple of years and see if it's still in development. Sometimes these \"why don't we make the game ourself\" gamer companies have a good vision about the game but lack skills to finish it and the result is something different. Wait at least until you are sure you don't miss the money invested. I don't miss the money but I've got too many games I regret buying. Refund and re-buy at the later time.",
